{"id": "en_quake_home_p2", "total": 73.33, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. The front door is completely jammed shut by heavy structural debris trapping Mark inside.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.26}, {"text": "Mark stays completely calm and uses a flashlight to inspect the blocked wooden exit door.", "start": 5.9, "end": 10.12}, {"text": "He remembers that running outside during active aftershocks creates massive risks from falling building parts.", "start": 10.48, "end": 15.24}, {"text": "He checks every nearby window to ensure he avoids glass and tall unstable furniture completely.", "start": 15.88, "end": 20.0}, {"text": "One. Drop to his hands and knees to protect himself from any sudden structural movement.", "start": 19.470000000000002, "end": 24.34}, {"text": "Two. Cover his head and neck securely under a sturdy wooden table sitting right beside him.", "start": 24.05, "end": 29.04}, {"text": "Three. Hold on tightly to the heavy table legs while another minor tremor rattles the house.", "start": 28.87, "end": 33.74}, {"text": "After the ground stops moving completely, Mark checks the surrounding air for any dangerous gas leaks.", "start": 34.48, "end": 38.32}, {"text": "He knows that leaving the damaged building is necessary only if he detects a strong gas smell.", "start": 38.84, "end": 42.76}, {"text": "Mark finds zero gas leaks in the air, so he decides to wait safely indoors now.", "start": 43.52, "end": 47.06}, {"text": "He listens carefully for emergency responders shouting instructions outside his blocked residential street tonight.", "start": 47.72, "end": 52.08}, {"text": "Sirens echo loudly through the dark neighborhood as rescue teams arrive to clear away heavy debris.", "start": 52.72, "end": 56.7}, {"text": "A firefighter opens the jammed front door safely and guides Mark out into the cool night air.", "start": 57.44, "end": 60.92}, {"text": "Mark escapes the damaged house safely without a single scratch thanks to his smart survival choices.", "start"